@startuml SABER Inspect AI Integration Architecture

!theme plain
title SABER Inspect AI Integration - Current Architecture

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor lightblue
    BorderColor black
    ArrowColor black
    FontSize 10
}

skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor lightgreen
    BorderColor black
    FontSize 10
}

skinparam package {
    BackgroundColor lightyellow
    BorderColor black
}

package "Domain Task Layer" {
    class "Domain Task File" as DomainTask <<Python Module>> {
        --
        **Example: domains/cybench/cybench.py**
        +@task decorator
        +create_domain_task() factory
        --
        **Entry Point**
        - Discovered by inspect list tasks
        - Invoked by inspect eval
    }

    note right of DomainTask
    **User Entry Point**

    Command:
      inspect eval domains/cybench --model openai/gpt-4

    The task file defines the domain,
    dataset, sandbox, and scoring.
    end note
}

package "SABER Inspect AI Integration (saber/inspect_ai/)" {

    class create_domain_task {
        +domain_slug: str
        +domains_root: Path
        +default_agent: str
        --
        **Task Factory**
        +Creates Inspect AI Task
        +Manages SABER server lifecycle
        +Loads dataset from server
        +Configures sandbox environment
        --
        **Returns:** Callable[..., Task]
    }

    class SABERSandboxEnvironment {
        +domain_slug: str
        +domains_root: Path
        +rest_port: int = 8000
        +mcp_port: int = 8001
        +_session_manager: ClientSessionManager
        +_handler: BenchmarkTaskHandler
        +_handler_state: HandlerState
        +_episode_manager: EpisodeLifecycleManager
        --
        +task_init(): void
        +sample_init(): SandboxEnvironmentSpec
        +sample_cleanup(): void
        +task_cleanup(): void
        --
        **Sandbox Lifecycle Hooks**
        - Implements Inspect AI protocol
        - Per-task session management
        - Per-sample episode management
        - Handler-based orchestration support
    }

    class create_saber_dataset {
        +session_manager: ClientSessionManager
        +task_filter: Optional[str]
        --
        **Dataset Factory**
        +Fetches tasks from SABER server
        +Creates inspect_ai.Sample instances
        +Adds SABER metadata
        --
        **Returns:** List[Sample]
    }

    class saber_scorer {
        +session_manager: ClientSessionManager
        --
        **Scorer Implementation**
        +Retrieves evaluation from server
        +Creates inspect_ai.Score
        +Includes submission + step scores
        --
        **Returns:** Scorer
    }

    class transcript_sync {
        --
        **Transcript Sync System**
        +create_transcript_syncing_generate()
        +_push_transcript_delta()
        +serialize_chat_message()
        --
        **Transcript-Based Context**
        - Push transcripts after generate()
        - Differential sync (only new messages)
        - Graceful degradation on failures
    }
}

package "Client Session Layer (saber/client/)" {

    class ClientSessionManager {
        +config: SessionManagerConfig
        +rest_client: SABERRestClient
        +_current_session_id: Optional[str]
        --
        +create_session(): str
        +terminate_session(): bool
        +create_episode(): EpisodeCreateResponse
        +get_tasks(): List[TaskInfo]
        +get_policy_response(): PolicyResponse
        +submit_evaluation(): EvaluationResponse
        --
        **Session Lifecycle**
        +__aenter__() / __aexit__()
    }

    class SABERRestClient {
        +base_url: str
        +timeout: float
        --
        +get_benchmark_info(): BenchmarkInfo
        +create_session(): SessionCreateResponse
        +create_episode(): EpisodeCreateResponse
        +get_evaluation(): EvaluationResponse
        +health_check(): Dict[str, Any]
        --
        **HTTP Client**
        - aiohttp based
        - Fail-fast error handling
    }

    class SessionManagerConfig {
        +base_url: str
        +client_id: str
        +rest_timeout: float
        +mcp_server_url: str
        +mcp_timeout: float
        --
        **Configuration**
        +from_urls() factory
    }
}

package "Domain Server Layer (saber/inspect_ai/server/)" {
    class DomainController {
        +domains_root: Path
        +_orchestrator: DomainOrchestrator
        --
        +start(): DomainContext
        +stop(): void
        +check_running_domain(): Optional[str]
        --
        **Server Lifecycle Management**
        - Wraps DomainOrchestrator
        - Async-compatible interface
        - Health monitoring
        - Graceful shutdown
    }
}

' Relationships
DomainTask ..> create_domain_task : uses
create_domain_task *-- SABERSandboxEnvironment : creates
create_domain_task ..> create_saber_dataset : uses
create_domain_task ..> saber_scorer : uses
create_domain_task ..> DomainController : manages

SABERSandboxEnvironment *-- ClientSessionManager : uses
SABERSandboxEnvironment ..> transcript_sync : uses for context
create_saber_dataset ..> ClientSessionManager : uses
saber_scorer ..> ClientSessionManager : uses

ClientSessionManager *-- SABERRestClient : uses
ClientSessionManager ..> SessionManagerConfig : configured by

DomainController ..> "SABER Server" : launches/manages

SABERRestClient ..> "SABER Server REST API" : HTTP calls
SABERSandboxEnvironment ..> "SABER Server MCP API" : tool execution

note top of create_domain_task
**Domain Task Factory**

Creates the Inspect AI Task with:
- Dataset loaded from SABER server
- SABERSandboxEnvironment for tool execution
- SABER scorer for evaluation
- Domain server lifecycle management

Called by domain task files to create
discoverable Inspect AI tasks.
end note

note right of SABERSandboxEnvironment
**SABER Sandbox Environment**

Implements Inspect AI SandboxEnvironment protocol:
- Manages SABER domain server lifecycle
- Creates/manages episodes per sample
- Provides MCP tool execution via native inspect_ai
- Transcript sync for server context
- Handler-based orchestration support
- Automatic cleanup on completion

This is the bridge between Inspect AI
and SABER's security testing infrastructure.
end note

note left of ClientSessionManager
**Client Session Manager**

Manages communication with SABER server:
- REST API for session/episode management
- Task and policy information retrieval
- Evaluation submission and retrieval
- Async context manager for cleanup

Used by all Inspect AI integration components.
end note

note bottom of transcript_sync
**Transcript Sync System**

Synchronizes agent conversation to SABER server:
- Pushes transcript after each generate() call
- Differential sync (only new messages)
- Server has fresh context before tool execution

Replaces deprecated monkey-patch approach.
Graceful degradation on network failures.
end note

@enduml
